e main diagonal are all ones, and the rest of the entries are zeros.\n\n- $N$ is *not* an identity matrix since it's not a square matrix.\n\n- $P$ is *not* an identity matrix. Although it's a diagonal matrix, its diagonal entries are not all ones.\n\nTherefore, only $M$ is an identity matrix."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335968 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b0425408-bacb-5919-a589-b3081614a229" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467776} {:answer/id #uuid "e96485ed-24ce-529e-b823-908ac2173298" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467777}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b0425408-bacb-5919-a589-b3081614a229" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467776} :answer-field/id #uuid "68ce6a69-ed67-542d-8652-e8801b01e030" :answer-field/key "F" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468609} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8b2dfaec-3d26-5c23-b0ef-cfaf5ccd4979" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467778} {:answer/id #uuid "6b0180d7-4a35-5c31-9d35-aabac4cbf98f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467779}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6b0180d7-4a35-5c31-9d35-aabac4cbf98f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467779} :answer-field/id #uuid "8a517350-7515-5c5d-bb02-4b6e87c7c3df" :answer-field/key "H" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468610} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0ba6545c-1daa-5a70-8142-9c4d6ff9b0e0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467780} {:answer/id #uuid "63692e72-3309-5f47-a7b7-d78cbf6d9dd4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :ans